{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/StoryBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an obsolete model of space drone created for one purpose: mining resources. You were meant to be taken out of commission along with the others, but somehow, you've awakened just in time to avoid the culling. You know that there is an entire Universe out there for you to explore, but it won't be so simple: the other drones can sense that you've gone rogue, and will attempt to destroy you on sight. Your new mission: build  enormous strength, wealth and infrastructure necessary to overcome the tremendous power of The Corporation, and escape to a remote area of space far from its control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Infrastructure_Banner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Building.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape far enough away from the reaches of The Corporation, you will ultimately need to build a Wormhole Machine. To accomplish this, you will need many supporting factories constructing the necessary parts and Generators to power them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/WealthBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Mining.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fund this colossal construction project, you will need a vast amount of resources, obtained primarily by blasting asteroids to pieces. You'll also collect rare loot from destroying enemies, and the occasional lost crate of supplies you may come across during your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/PowerBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Combat.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive the relentless assault from your fellow drones, you'll also use your precious mined resources and spoils of combat to upgrade, modify, and boost your ship's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/FeaturesBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong>: Seven procedurally generated areas with infinite asteroids to mine and enemies to blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong>: 24 different ship components to upgrade individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modify</strong>: More than 80 ship modifications (and more coming!) which fundamentally change how the ship behaves, or how you will play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Construct</strong>: Buildings which help you to multiply your resources and accumulate the wealth needed to manufacture Wormhole Machine parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARPG-Style Looting</strong>: Tons of loot to mine from asteroids and collect from enemies including materials for upgrades/construction, gems which give temporary buffs when used, rare magical orbs which give a permanent buff while equipped, ship modifications and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595590?t=1746251050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/ebd59ff44824cb9962dd67e34f3ab41f57ae484b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746251050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/d5523e08e2e55798d6f7d797f79e8685f4707b6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746251050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/d5523e08e2e55798d6f7d797f79e8685f4707b6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746251050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/StoryBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an obsolete model of space drone created for one purpose: mining resources. You were meant to be taken out of commission along with the others, but somehow, you've awakened just in time to avoid the culling. You know that there is an entire Universe out there for you to explore, but it won't be so simple: the other drones can sense that you've gone rogue, and will attempt to destroy you on sight. Your new mission: build  enormous strength, wealth and infrastructure necessary to overcome the tremendous power of The Corporation, and escape to a remote area of space far from its control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Infrastructure_Banner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Building.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to escape far enough away from the reaches of The Corporation, you will ultimately need to build a Wormhole Machine. To accomplish this, you will need many supporting factories constructing the necessary parts and Generators to power them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/WealthBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Mining.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fund this colossal construction project, you will need a vast amount of resources, obtained primarily by blasting asteroids to pieces. You'll also collect rare loot from destroying enemies, and the occasional lost crate of supplies you may come across during your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/PowerBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/Combat.gif?t=1746251050\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To survive the relentless assault from your fellow drones, you'll also use your precious mined resources and spoils of combat to upgrade, modify, and boost your ship's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/FeaturesBanner.png?t=1746251050\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong>: Seven procedurally generated areas with infinite asteroids to mine and enemies to blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade</strong>: 24 different ship components to upgrade individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modify</strong>: More than 80 ship modifications (and more coming!) which fundamentally change how the ship behaves, or how you will play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Construct</strong>: Buildings which help you to multiply your resources and accumulate the wealth needed to manufacture Wormhole Machine parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARPG-Style Looting</strong>: Tons of loot to mine from asteroids and collect from enemies including materials for upgrades/construction, gems which give temporary buffs when used, rare magical orbs which give a permanent buff while equipped, ship modifications and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Super-V"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/f35bbfdaf070d0713328bf17b488e5baa14edeaa/header.jpg?t=1746251050","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122262,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122262/movie480.mp4?t=1745944402","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122262/movie_max.mp4?t=1745944402"},"name":"First Look","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122262/67d1db5bf9aaa8187183b5501a15d872ac20cfa2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745944402","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122262/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745944402","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122262/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745944402"}}],"name":"SPACEROCKS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i7-4790<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\